== framing check (ffmpeg -frames:v 1 on each loop, both frames read)
Landmarks compared against my_avatar.png: bin at ~12 % of frame width, dark tower spanning
~23–39 %, face ~15.6 % of frame width, head top at ~7–8 % of frame height. Identical fractions
in my_avatar.png (900x502), my-hero-avatar.mp4 (640x360) and my-avatar.mp4 (1280x720): one
composition at three resolutions, aspect 1.792 / 1.778 / 1.778. The 1280x720 loop is therefore a
drop-in for the still's framing at twice the pixels of the 640x360 loop, with no scale jump on
the crossfade.

